@startuml SpeakCoach_7_Pillars_Framework
!define C1 #6C9FFF
!define C2 #A78BFA
!define C3 #67E8F9
!define C4 #6EE7B7
!define C5 #FDBA74
!define C6 #F9A8D4
!define C7 #FCA5A5

skinparam backgroundColor #0a0a1a
skinparam defaultFontColor #f0f0f8
skinparam defaultFontName Inter
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam ArrowColor #6C9FFF
skinparam BorderColor #6C9FFF

title "Les 7 Piliers de l'Agentique IA — SpeakCoach"
' Architecture conceptuelle des 7 piliers essentiels

' Layer 0: Core LLM (au centre)
card "🧠 **LLM**\nMoteur de\nRaisonnement" as LLM #6C9FFF/f0f0f8

' Layer 1: Les 7 piliers autour
card "📝 **1. Prompt\nEngineering**\n\n✓ Role-based\n✓ Constraints\n✓ Format JSON" as P1 #6C9FFF/f0f0f8
card "🧠 **2. Context\nEngineering**\n\nMemory:\n✓ Short-term\n✓ Long-term" as P2 #A78BFA/f0f0f8
card "🔧 **3. Tool\nCalling**\n\nOutils:\n✓ FastAPI\n✓ PostgreSQL" as P3 #67E8F9/f0f0f8
card "📊 **4. Observability**\n\nVibilité:\n✓ Logs\n✓ Traces\n✓ State" as P4 #6EE7B7/f0f0f8
card "🔄 **5. Agent\nLoop**\n\nCycle:\n✓ Perception\n✓ Raisonnement\n✓ Action" as P5 #FDBA74/f0f0f8
card "🛡️ **6. Safety**\n\nGarde-fou:\n✓ Limits\n✓ Validation\n✓ Rate-limit" as P6 #F9A8D4/f0f0f8
card "⚙️ **7. Agent\nHarness**\n\nInfra:\n✓ LangGraph\n✓ Spring AI" as P7 #FCA5A5/f0f0f8

' Connexions des piliers au centre
P1 --> LLM
P2 --> LLM
P3 --> LLM
P4 --> LLM
P5 --> LLM
P6 --> LLM
P7 --> LLM

' Interactions entre piliers
P1 <--> P2 : Contexte\nenrichi
P2 <--> P3 : Tools\naccess
P3 <--> P4 : Logging\nresults
P4 <--> P5 : Trace\nloop
P5 <--> P6 : Safety\nchecks
P6 <--> P7 : Harness\nexecute
P7 <--> P1 : Deploy

' Vue des agents spécialisés qui utilisent ce framework
note bottom of LLM
    Agents spécialisés (utilisant tous les 7 piliers):
    • Chatbot Agent (Piliers 1,2,4,5,7)
    • LevelTest Agent (Piliers 1,2,3,4,5,6,7)
    • Exercise Agent (Piliers 1,2,3,4,5,6,7)
end note

caption <b>Tous les 7 piliers interconnectés</b> → Framework complet d'agentique IA
